<div id="A6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">And replace TSRL to TSBD in other algorithm, we can get Bandit meta-learning algorithm. The differences are mainly concentrated in choice of <math id="A6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{ih}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{ih}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
